10:T64c,<h1>BNB Chain DeFi Guide: Staking, BEP-20 Tokens, and Verifying Smart Contracts</h1>
<p>BNB Smart Chain offers fast transactions, low fees, and a mature DeFi ecosystem, making it practical for platforms distributing frequent on-chain rewards.</p>
<h2>BNB Smart Chain vs Ethereum</h2>
<table>
<thead>
<tr>
<th>Feature</th>
<th>BNB Smart Chain</th>
<th>Ethereum</th>
</tr>
</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td>Block time</td>
<td>~3 seconds</td>
<td>~12 seconds</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Avg transaction fee</td>
<td>~$0.10-0.30</td>
<td>$2-50+</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Token standard</td>
<td>BEP-20</td>
<td>ERC-20</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td>Main DEX</td>
<td>PancakeSwap</td>
<td>Uniswap</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
<h2>How to Verify a Smart Contract on BSCScan</h2>
<ol>
<li>Go to bscscan.com</li>
<li>Enter the contract address</li>
<li>Click the Contract tab</li>
<li>Look for the green checkmark indicating verified source code</li>
</ol>
<p>WolvCapital's three contracts are all verified and open-source:</p>
<ul>
<li>WOLV Token: 0xe0167279aef7bf4ad313d261da82e8366822270c</li>
<li>Staking Contract: 0x4b62efee5695ed55cd362a0b818f4c5f9694322b</li>
<li>Reward Pool: 0xb233cf74b14abf9d9702d585c540030125599579</li>
</ul>
<h2>PancakeSwap and WOLV Listing</h2>
<p>WolvCapital plans to list WOLV on PancakeSwap in Q3 2026 with initial liquidity to support price stability. Pre-listing, WOLV has an internal reference price of $1.00.</p>
<p>Always verify contracts, read risk disclosures, and invest only what you can afford to lose.</p>
